# Everything in this repo is consumed by Linux containers. A checkout on Windows
# with core.autocrlf=true (Git for Windows' default) otherwise produces CRLF shell
# scripts, which the image build COPYs in and bash then refuses:
#   "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M" / "$'\r': command not found"
# The failure surfaces during the build or, worse, at container start, and names
# nothing about line endings.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never touch these.
*.app       binary
*.dll       binary
*.exe       binary
*.so        binary
*.bak       binary
*.bclicense binary
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.zip       binary
*.nupkg     binary
stubs/reporting-service-stub binary
